# Cross-origin isolation so the embedded FluidCAD viewer iframe gets
# SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded OCJS WASM). `credentialless` instead of
# `require-corp` keeps CORP-less third-party scripts (GTM/gtag) loading; on
# browsers without credentialless support (Safari) the page is simply not
# isolated and ViewerEmbed falls back to opening the viewer in a new tab.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
